      "classification": "state_assertion",
      "scope_tags": [
        "aws",
        "s3"
      ],
      "defect": "The bucket grants s3:ListBucket to an anonymous or wildcard principal (public_list = true) without the public_list_intended tag set to true. The catalog treats intentional listing as acceptable (for software download mirrors, archives, and documented-public catalogs) — absence of the tag means listing is almost certainly unintended.\n",
      "infection": "Anonymous callers can enumerate every object key in the bucket via a single API call. Enumeration is the step attackers most often lack when objects themselves are publicly readable but unlisted — without a key, a plain public-read bucket is safer than its ACL suggests. Public list removes that obscurity, converting \"attackers must guess keys\" into \"attackers pull the manifest.\" Automated scanners specifically enumerate bucket contents via list-bucket and archive the manifest even if individual objects are not immediately readable.\n",
      "failure": "Catalog exfiltration. Every object's key, size, modification time, and (often) content hash becomes attacker-known. If some objects are additionally public-readable, those become mass-harvestable via list-then-get. If objects are not public-readable, the manifest still discloses data- classification metadata (filenames often reveal sensitivity), business operations (backup cadence, batch-job naming), and organizational structure (folder layouts mirroring team hierarchies).\n",
      "delta": [
        {
          "property_label": "public list access",
          "property_path": "storage.access.public_list",
          "current_value": "true",
          "fix_action": "set to false (disable)"
        },
        {
          "property_label": "public-list-intended tag",
          "property_path": "storage.tags.public_list_intended",
          "current_value": "",
          "fix_action": "populate this property in the configuration"
        },
        {
          "property_label": "public-list-intended tag",
          "property_path": "storage.tags.public_list_intended",
          "current_value": "",
          "fix_action": "set to true"
        }
      ],
